  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">Kids&amp;Us, school of english, en la plaza Corts Valencianes, 9 de Onda, realiza estos d&iacute;as la Fun Week de Pascua, en la que se combinan las clases con actividades pr&aacute;cticas, como el&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">&nbsp;mercado (Market), en la mayor&iacute;a de las fotos</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.33333396911621px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">. Tambi&eacute;n hay psicomotricidad, taller de teatro (Performances), la hora del cuento (Story time), manualidades (Crafts) y canciones tem&aacute;ticas (Songs). A la hora del recreo, juegan en el jard&iacute;n de la plaza, tambi&eacute;n en ingl&eacute;s.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paqsquakidsusonda/img_5254.jpg\" alt=\"img_5254\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paqsquakidsusonda/img_5255.jpg\" alt=\"img_5255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paqsquakidsusonda/img_5257.jpg\" alt=\"img_5257\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paqsquakidsusonda/img_5258.jpg\" alt=\"img_5258\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paqsquakidsusonda/img_5259.jpg\" alt=\"img_5259\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paqsquakidsusonda/img_5260.jpg\" alt=\"img_5260\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /